{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13562","headline":"寄浙东皇甫中丞 · 秦系","name":"寄浙东皇甫中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲闲麋鹿或相随，一两年来鬓欲衰。\n琴砚共依春酒瓮，云霞覆着破柴篱。\n注书不向时流说，种药空令道者知。\n久带纱巾仍藉草，山中那得见朝仪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"秦系","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13562.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13562","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}